8-08-16', 'https://www.djuringa-juniors.fr/media/Sejours_Colonie/Ete/2026/ID3476/img/colonie-de-vacances-djuringa-juniors-cirque-80_800x600.jpg', 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2028-08-02', 24, 0, 0, 10.00, 9, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.djuringa-juniors.fr/reve-de-cirque-3476.html', 'https://www.djuringa-juniors.fr/reve-de-cirque-3476.html', 0, 0, '09b8d7fddc', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Inu_BVWKFYc?si=bXKoFHq86AaeojUz', 0, NULL, 0, 'VacancesCirque, Enfants, Loisirs, ActivitesCircassiennes, CirqueEnfants, ArtsCircassiens, SpectacleFinal, Costume, Maquillage, CirqueMagique', NULL, 'France', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-22 16:39:20', 0, 'Cirque', '2025-12-22 16:39:20', 0, 0),
